Upstream attribution
--------------------

This package is a DeepSeek Harness port of the ZCode official `ios-simulator`
plugin (`@zcode/ios-simulator-plugin`, version 0.1.0), which Z.ai distributes
under the MIT License.

    Original work: Copyright (c) Z.ai
    Plugin:        ios-simulator 0.1.0 (ZCode official plugin, Z.ai)
    Licence:       MIT

The MIT terms reproduced above apply to the upstream work as well, and the
upstream copyright notice applies to it in addition to the notice at the top of
this file. Material ported from that plugin:

  - the 20 tool definitions with their names, descriptions and argument
    schemas, and the `ios_preflight`, simulator (`simctl`), project discovery
    and scaffolding, `xcodebuild` orchestration, screenshot, log and `idb` UI
    providers derived from it;
  - the generated SwiftUI starter project — `App.swift`, `ContentView.swift`
    and the Xcode 14-compatible `project.pbxproj` — kept verbatim;
  - the `ios-dev` skill text, adapted for DSH;
  - the plugin icon (`ios-simulator.png`), which is that plugin's marketplace
    artwork (published at
    `https://cdn-zcode.z.ai/zcode/official-plugin/assets/ios-simulator/icon.png`),
    kept as published apart from cropping its flat margin and downscaling it to
    the size DSH renders.

Everything else — the DSH host half, the browser half and its settings page,
the macOS-only host gate, the settings schema, the test suite and the scripts —
is original to this package and covered by the notice at the top of this file.
